    "body": "Thanks for looking in to this. However I'm pretty confused about what you're trying to demonstrate. The example you give results in 1234[abcd]56789, at least in browsers: https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=7185. And the sentence you quote applies to the 1-argument or \"preserve\" versions of setRangeText, but your post shows using the three-argument version.",
