    "body": "Yes, I think that is exactly the bug. There was no text selected before the call to setRangeText, and this should be preserved, as this selection is also not in the middle of the text that it replaced.\r\n\r\nI was referring to the \"preserve\" version, which is the same as calling with three arguments.\r\n\r\nFirefox and Chromium follow the current standard and exhibit this bug.",
