    "body": "I see. Sorry for the confusion about three-argument vs. four, especially after I closed your other ticket for exactly that reason.\r\n\r\nI'd like to separate out two things here:\r\n\r\n* Is the current text self-contradictory? If so we should fix it (without changing the normative results of the algorithm).\r\n* Do you want to change the actual results of the algorithm to do something different than what browsers currently do? If so, that's a discussion we need to have with implementers, to see if they're willing to take on the potential interop and compat risks.",
