    "created_at": "2019-09-06T07:22:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-06T07:22:41Z",
    "body": "I don't think we can change the behavior of `setSelectionRange` or `setRangeText` at this point. There is simply too much web content out there that depends on the current behavior of these methods regardless of whether they make most sense or not.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
