    "created_at": "2019-09-06T07:52:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-06T07:52:51Z",
    "body": "Note that it is only about fixing the behaviour of `setRangeText` (not `setSelectionRange`) and only for one value of the `selectMode` parameter and only for one special case (selection start==end).\r\n\r\nBreaking compatibility with existing code (which relies on the buggy behaviour) is probably less of an issue than it may seem.",
