    "created_at": "2019-09-07T04:40:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-07T04:40:19Z",
    "body": "Just to drive the point home, here is a more simple example (converting text to uppercase letters). It shows the issue exists even for delta=0, where the semantics of \"preserving the selection\" are easier to grasp.\r\n\r\nhttps://jsfiddle.net/thenlich/s24xcwk6/9/",
