    "created_at": "2019-09-10T13:49:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-10T13:49:57Z",
    "body": "In order to describe the current behaviour, the (non-normative) description would also have to be changed from\r\n\r\n> Attempts to preserve the selection.\r\n\r\nto something along the lines of\r\n\r\n> Attempts to preserve the selection **_unless it immediately follows the replaced text_**.\r\n",
